  "description": "Hard sync to an operator: a saw synced to a sine six cents above the note, whose period it repeats at; every note sweeps the saw’s ratio from 6 down to 1.5 over about 2.5 s (LFO 2, a one-shot falling saw, Ratio depth 2 octaves), and the sine sounds underneath. Play single notes C3–C5, gate 1–3 s; the mod wheel adds vibrato. Mixer: echo send 0.25, plate 0.2.",
